    "Expect: Player 1 slot2 gets AP+3 during this turn (AP modifier state such as continueModifyAP +3), and exactly 1 Player 1 energy card becomes rested (Cost 1).",
    "Action: End Player 1 turn. On Player 2 turn, attack Player 1 shield area with Player 2 slot3 GD01-020_attacker_p2_0003 and resolve confirmBattle for both players.",
    "Expect: BURST_EFFECT_CHOICE appears for Player 1 on GD01-120 from shield.",
    "Action: Confirm Burst activation and choose Player 2 slot3 GD01-020_attacker_p2_0003 as the enemy Unit target.",
    "Expect: Chosen enemy Unit gets AP-3 during this turn (AP modifier state such as continueModifyAP -3), and GD01-120 moves from Player 1 shield area to hand.",
    "Action: End Player 2 turn.",
    "Expect: Temporary AP modifiers from GD01-120 expire at end of their respective turns."
